{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝から沢山ご飯を食べておなかいっぱいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、さっきまでずっと数学の勉強してました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやぁ難しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中まで出来ても答えに中々たどりつけない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"難しすぎる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学二年復習をしてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忘れてるのも多すぎる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこで私はパソコンで調べることにしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして一時間半くらいすると"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜだかわかんないけど\nインターネットが繋がらなくなったんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかく集中してたのに......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てことで暇になったのでお母さんに電話しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お兄ちゃんとお父さんと三人でお出掛けてたみたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもお兄ちゃんに数学の勉強を電話しながら教えてもらい\nなんとか解くことができました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お父さんとお兄ちゃんは\n数学得意なんだって"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからお父さんとmailしながら教えてもらってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは引き続きがんばりまーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑癒しのライオン夫婦"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前\nおじぃちゃんとおばぁちゃんと、ひぃばぁちゃんで動物園行ったときに撮ったよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやが動物園大好きだから"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おじいちゃんが誘ってくれたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ち良さそうに寝てるっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(寝てるから起こさないように......)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のコメントは沢山の方がコメントをくれて、ビックリしてとっても嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電車や、バス、車、徒歩、自転車、等々\nビックリしたのは歩いて30秒って方もいたり、2時間かかってる方もいたり、\nまあやと同じように満員電車に乗ってる方もいましたね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆も頑張ってるんだと思ったらパワー出てきた〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京にきて本当に満員電車の人の数にビックリしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやの実家の近くではバスも1時間に1本あるかないかくらいだから...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ？もうまぁや家の近くのあのバスなくなったんだっけ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、家族とはどこか行った？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※次回は絶対質問返しします(*_*)sorry\nそして、ブログの意見を参考にもう少しベットの虫除けみたいなカーテンつけときますっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(^^)/Thank You"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/27/8776965/0011.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}